ADDITIONAL SECURITY NOTICE (not part of the MIT licence text above)

This project is an EDUCATIONAL, DEFENSIVE security tool.

* It analyses passwords that the user voluntarily submits, in memory, and
  provides educational strength estimates and security advice.
* It deliberately contains NO password-cracking, credential-stuffing,
  credential-harvesting or authentication-bypass functionality.
* A strength score from this tool is an EDUCATIONAL ESTIMATE. It is not a
  guarantee of account security, and it is not a compliance certification.
* Do not deploy this tool to collect real user passwords. Use synthetic demo
  values in demonstrations, screenshots and coursework.
